# ============================================================================
# MTG2A04_L01_S01 — «परी की पिकनिक की खरीदारी»
# ============================================================================

# ---- SECRETS — never commit ------------------------------------------------
# .env holds a live Gemini API key. A key that reaches a remote is compromised
# even if the commit is later removed (it stays in history and every clone).
# If one is ever pushed, ROTATE IT — do not try to scrub the history instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
secrets.json
credentials.json
service-account*.json

# ---- generated review artefacts --------------------------------------------
# Regenerated by scripts/_shots.py + scripts/_drive.py; large and churny.
# Drop this line if you want the review captures in the repo for the SME.
_review_shots/
_audition/
_build_report.json

# ---- raw generator output + logs -------------------------------------------
# Unkeyed Gemini originals (19 MB); the keyed PNGs in assets/Images are the art.
scripts/_art_raw/
scripts/_*_log*.txt
*.log

# ---- build + tooling noise -------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/

# ---- local dist / packaging ------------------------------------------------
# Rebuilt from the working build by scripts/make_dist.py.
# Drop this line if you deploy straight from the repo (e.g. Netlify/Vercel on dist/).
dist/
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# ---- backups and scratch ---------------------------------------------------
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
card.pre_revise.json
*.pre_revise.*
scratch/
tmp/

# ---- OS + editor + Office lock files ---------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
*.swp
*~
~$*

# ============================================================================
# DELIBERATELY TRACKED — do not add these to the list above
# ============================================================================
# MTG2A04_L01_S01.html        generated, but it IS the playable build.
# card.json                   generated; kept so a clone can read the content.
# scripts/_vo_text.json       the builder compares it with the new text to delete
#                             exactly the voice clips whose line changed. Untrack it
#                             and stale audio silently survives a text edit.
# assets/**                   the art and voice-over ARE the lesson (incl. assets/Currency,
#                             the team's source currency set).
# engine/lesson_template.html generated by engine/inject_money.py, but it is what the
#                             builder stamps the card into; keep it so a clone can build.
# _draft_original/            the SME's first draft, kept as the before-picture.
